{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<?ui-args --schema urn:example:custom=tests/ui/schemas/amplified.xsd?>\n<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" xmlns:c=\"urn:example:custom\" initial=\"a\">\n  <final id=\"a\"><onentry><c:mark/></onentry></final>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd006-schema-budget.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd006-schema-budget.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":7,"endLine":2,"startColumn":2,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"XSD content-model expansion limit exceeded (maximum 1000000)\n\n**Note:** schema size, content-model expansion, compilation, and validation work are preflighted so hostile schemas cannot exhaust the validator. Content-model expansion and compilation work grow faster than the schema, so they are bounded on every build; schema count, size, and instance validation work are bounded on wasm builds only (the shipped validator component)\n\n**Help:** reduce large `maxOccurs` values, nested repetition, or schema size\n\n**Spec:** XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.9 Particles","text":"XSD content-model expansion limit exceeded (maximum 1000000)"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":77,"start":72},"category":"schema"},"ruleId":"XSD006"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"schema size, content-model expansion, compilation, and validation work are preflighted so hostile schemas cannot exhaust the validator. Content-model expansion and compilation work grow faster than the schema, so they are bounded on every build; schema count, size, and instance validation work are bounded on wasm builds only (the shipped validator component)"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: reduce large `maxOccurs` values, nested repetition, or schema size.\n\nSpecification: XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.9 Particles\n\nRun `scx --explain XSD006` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-1/#cParticles","id":"XSD006","name":"XSD006","properties":{"category":"schema"},"shortDescription":{"text":"schema or instance validation work exceeds a bounded budget"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}